  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Master in Sustainability Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a financial support for the ASEAN Master in Sustainability Management project that aims to produce managerially competent and socially responsible candidates for key posts both in governmental institutions and businesses enterprises, who will partake in leading the economic development towards environmental sustainability in the ASEAN region.</narrative>
  </description>
